    "body": "@mustaqahmed should probably take a look.\n\nOverall I don't think other specifications should set the last activation timestamp directly because then the concept will be very hard to understand. Instead we probably need to come up with some abstraction that WebRTC could adopt. (Which might come down to a similar thing, but then at least the entirety of the flow is clear from HTML.)",
